        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the &#8216;/wp-content/plugins/simple-wc-shoplinks&#8217; directory, or install via the WordPress Plugin Directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the <strong>Plugins</strong> menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Configure the settings via the <strong>Simple WC ShopLinks</strong> dashboard.</li>\n<li>Place the shortcode wherever you want the shop links to display.</li>\n</ol>\n",
